# Copy to builder/.env.local and fill in from your Supabase project:
#   Project Settings → API → Project URL and the `anon` `public` key.
#
# Both values are public by design and end up in the browser bundle. What
# protects your data is row-level security (supabase/schema.sql), not secrecy.
#
# NEVER put the `service_role` key here. It bypasses row-level security.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://yourproject.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...
